From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 04:23:39 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: implement CompositionEffectSourceParameter

Expose the WinRT factory and a name-bearing graphics effect source with correct COM identity and lifetime; add the dcomp activation regression.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit 6f44b448f1dd64e858906df6194190abe2556fdd)

